# FastAPI & asyncio

- Pydantic v2 models on all request/response and event boundaries.
- Keep routers thin; business logic in `services/`, I/O in `repositories/`.
- Always attach/propagate `X-Request-ID` (see `core/middleware.py`).
- Consumers belong in `consumers/`; do not start brokers inside route handlers.
- Use `Settings` from `core/config.py` via `get_settings()` — no scattered env reads.
- Never call Pillow/OpenCV/sync HTTP SDKs directly on the event loop.

```python
# ❌ BAD
def handle():
    Image.open(path).resize((512, 512))

# ✅ GOOD
await asyncio.to_thread(process_image, path)
```
